---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
const paths = (await getCollection('paths')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
---
<Base title="Start here">
  <h1>What did you get? Pick it. I'll tell you the order.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Every product I sell fits into one system. Buying a bundle or joining Knowii gives you a lot at once, and "a lot at once" is exactly how people stall. Pick what you own below and follow the steps in order. Skip what you already know.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    {paths.map((p) => (
      <a class="card" href={`/paths/${p.id}`} style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
        <h3>{p.data.title}</h3>
        <p class="meta">{p.data.purchase}</p>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>
  <div class="callout">Not sure which one applies? Your Gumroad receipt or your Knowii tier name tells you. Bought on Gumroad: your files are in your <a href="https://gumroad.com/library">Gumroad library</a>. Joined Knowii on knowii.net: everything is inside the community. Still lost? <a href="/help">Help</a>.</div>
  <p><a href="/free">Free resources</a> for everyone, whatever you own. <a href="/knowii">How Knowii is organized</a> if you're a member or about to be.</p>
  <h2>Two things that are true for every buyer</h2>
  <p>Whatever you bought, wherever you bought it, you're on my newsletter now. New editions, articles and news land at <a href="https://dsebastien.net">dsebastien.net</a> (<a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/blog/">articles</a>, <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/newsletter/">newsletter</a>, <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/news/">news</a>) and in your inbox. That's how you'll hear about updates to what you own.</p>
  <p>And whatever you bought, you're welcome in <a href="https://www.knowii.net">Knowii</a>. Product spaces (<a href="https://www.knowii.net/c/obsidian-starter-kit-lounge">Obsidian Starter Kit Discussions</a>, <a href="https://www.knowii.net/c/voice-ai-lounge">Voice AI Discussions</a>, and the others) are where support and questions happen, and where you meet the people using the same system.</p>
</Base>
